{"world_id":"wld_aetheria","title":"The Hollow Calm","logline":"When a windless night strands the isles and something ancient stirs in the abandoned skybridge roots, a stubborn cartographer must share her charts with the toll-master who wants them buried, or the breaking bridges will take every isle with them.","theme":"Truths shared are safer than truths hoarded.","acts":[{"id":"act_setup","title":"The Wind Stops","purpose":"setup","scenes":[{"id":"scn_silent_charts","title":"The Silent Charts","summary":"At Silverspine Academy, Veya reads her wind-sight charts and sees the currents die across the archipelago. The night goes windless, and her instruments show the skybridge roots below the isles trembling.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya"],"goal":"Veya wants to confirm that the calm is the start of the drift her late mentor predicted, and to chart a safe route through the breaking bridges.","conflict":"Her wind-sight reads nothing in the dead air, and her stubborn certainty clashes with the academy's caution about trusting unverified charts.","outcome":"She finds a pattern of faint pulses rising from the abandoned skybridge roots beneath the Hollow, and resolves to investigate despite the stillness."}},{"id":"scn_toll_in_the_calm","title":"Toll in the Calm","summary":"At Mistral Docks, becalmed ships crowd the port. Kael raises tolls on the few crossings that still hold, while he hears rumours of sounds beneath the bridges.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants to seize the last stable skybridge routes before the Cartel's monopoly collapses.","conflict":"Stranded merchants and the Bridge Wardens accuse him of sabotaging forge-island supplies, and his belief that price equals worth makes him ignore the rumours.","outcome":"He learns that Veya is mapping the safe routes and decides her charts must belong to the Cartel."}],"depends_on":[]},{"id":"act_setup_placeholder","title":"","purpose":"setup","scenes":[]}]}

