ves","summary":"Cartel enforcers announce a levy on grain shipments at The Hollow. Maris, who knows every silo in the archipelago, hears the news first and starts to plan a way to keep her isle fed.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris"],"goal":"Protect The Hollow's grain stores from the Cartel levy.","conflict":"Open resistance would invite reprisals, and Maris trusts slowly and has no allies outside her isle.","outcome":"Maris starts moving grain along unmapped service corridors, and she needs someone who can read the bridges to extend her routes.","depends_on":["scn_kael_sets_the_toll"]}]},{"id":"act_02_cables_and_ledgers","title":"Cables and Ledgers","purpose":"rising_action","scenes":[{"id":"scn_veya_seeks_the_wardens","title":"Veya Seeks the Wardens at Emberroost","summary":"Veya carries her chart to the forge-island of Emberroost, where the Bridge Wardens braid cloudstone cables, and warns them that several bridges will fail. Her wind-debt for the crossing is growing.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya"],"goal":"Persuade the Bridge Wardens to reinforce the bridges her chart marks as failing.","conflict":"The Wardens are short of cloudstone, which they blame on Cartel sabotage, and they doubt a chart that has not been peer reviewed. Veya will not accept that her predictions might be imprecise.","outcome":"The Wardens agree to reinforce one bridge as a trial and ask Veya to find a route they can protect.","depends_on":["scn_veya_charts_the_drift"]},{"id":"scn_kael_courts_veya","title":"Kael Offers Veya a Bargain","summary":"Kael meets Veya at Mistral Docks, where they were once apprentices together, and offers to fund her surveys if the Cartel owns the charts. He admires her skill but cannot let her succeed on her own terms.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants to buy Veya's charts. Veya wants to learn which routes the Cartel is targeting.","conflict":"Veya fears becoming like the ambitious cartel leaders and refuses, while Kael cannot let her chart without the Cartel's control.","outcome":"Veya refuses the bargain and Kael declares her charts a threat to the Cartel, so she needs allies and a hidden route.","depends_on":["scn_kael_sets_the_toll","scn_veya_seeks_the_wardens"]},{"id":"scn_veya_meets_maris","title":"Veya Meets Maris","summary":"Fleeing Cartel agents, Veya crosses to The Hollow and meets Maris. They trade Veya's wind-current knowledge for Maris's secret corridors, forming an alliance neither fully trusts yet.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants a hidden route to continue her survey. Maris wants help extending her smuggling paths.","conflict":"Maris is slow to trust a Warden-aligned outsider, and Veya's stubbornness clashes with her caution.","outcome":"They agree to share knowledge, and Maris guides Veya through unmapped corridors that reveal a stable route.","depends_on":["scn_grain_levy_announced","scn_kael_courts_veya"]},{"id":"scn_enforcers_close_in","title":"Enforcers Close In","summary":"Kael sends Cartel enforcers to The Hollow to enforce the levy and find the smuggling routes. Maris must hide her grain and choose between loyalty to her isle and her new friendship with Veya.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants to find the smuggling routes and the cartographer. Maris wants to keep the grain and the routes hidden.","conflict":"Maris's distrust almost leads her to hand Veya over, while Kael's charm nearly wins her cooperation.","outcome":"Maris hides the grain and refuses Kael, and the Cartel now knows a cartographer is working with the Hollow Circle.","depends_on":["scn_veya_meets_maris"]},{"id":"scn_the_sabotaged_bridge","title":"The Sabotaged Bridge","summary":"A skybridge near Emberroost severs after a spark in a place no open flame is allowed. Veya's wind-sight shows the bridge was already failing, but the Wardens blame Kael and the Cartel, and Veya refuses to admit her chart missed the exact timing.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants to find the cause of the failure. Kael wants to deny blame and turn the failure to the Cartel's advantage.","conflict":"The no-fire rule makes the spark damning, and Veya's pride keeps her from admitting the chart was off, which damages the Wardens' trust in her.","outcome":"The Wardens split over whether to trust Veya, the Toll War escalates, and Kael takes control of the remaining stable routes.","depends_on":["scn_enforcers_close_in"]},{"id":"scn_hidden_route_survey","title":"The Hidden Route Survey","summary":"Veya and Maris map the stable route together. Veya has to admit her own error to complete it, and Maris starts to forgive her.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Chart a complete safe route through the breaking network.","conflict":"The route depends on Veya correcting her earlier prediction, which she resists, and Maris is reluctant to reveal her secret corridors to a wider audience.","outcome":"Veya admits the error and the route is charted, but Maris must decide whether to share the corridors with the whole archipelago.","depends_on":["scn_the_sabotaged_bridge"]}]},{"id":"act_03_the_last_bridge","title":"The Last Bridge","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_cartel_seizes_the_route","title":"The Cartel Seizes the Route","summary":"Kael moves to seize the last stable skybridge route and the charts, using the grain levy as leverage against The Hollow.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Kael wants to seize the final stable route. Maris wants to protect her isle's grain.","conflict":"Kael's ledger-mastery targets the Hollow Circle's weakest point, and Maris has to decide whether to go public with her secret corridors.","outcome":"Maris chooses to stand openly rather than hide, and she sends word to Veya.","depends_on":["scn_hidden_route_survey"]},{"id":"scn_veya_shares_the_charts","title":"Veya Shares the Charts","summary":"At Silverspine Academy, Veya meets Kael as the bridges begin to fail. She chooses to publish her charts to everyone rather than let Kael hoard them.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to get the safe route to every isle. Kael wants to stop her and own the route.","conflict":"Kael offers Veya the recognition she wants if she keeps the charts private, and her fear of becoming like him is tested against her wish for credit.","outcome":"Veya publishes the charts openly and the route is used by every isle, and Kael sees control cost him the monopoly he was seeking.","depends_on":["scn_cartel_seizes_the_route"]}]},{"id":"act_04_after_the_drift","title":"After the Drift","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_kael_counts_the_cost","title":"Kael Counts the Cost","summary":"At Mistral Docks, Kael faces the Cartel's losses and sees that control cost more than it gained, and he ends the grain levy.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael"],"goal":"Salvage what he can of the Cartel's position.","conflict":"His belief that price equals worth fights with what he has seen, and the Cartel's princes want to keep the levy.","outcome":"Kael ends the levy and opens the tolls, and the Toll War ends.","depends_on":["scn_veya_shares_the_charts"]},{"id":"scn_the_hollow_feasts","title":"The Hollow Feasts","summary":"The Hollow's windmills keep grinding as the route opens, and Maris sees that hiding can be as brave as standing, and that she can do both.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Restore the grain trade and the friendship between Maris and Veya.","conflict":"Maris still struggles to forgive and to trust, and wind-debts left by the crisis must still be repaid.","outcome":"Maris and Veya renew their alliance and the Hollow Circle trades openly again.","depends_on":["scn_kael_counts_the_cost"]},{"id":"scn_new_charts_new_bridges","title":"New Charts, New Bridges","summary":"At Emberroost, Veya and the Wardens braid new cables along the shared route, with her charts open to everyone, and Veya accepts that the work belongs to all.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris","chr_kael"],"goal":"Begin rebuilding the skybridge network along the shared route.","conflict":"Old suspicions between the Wardens and the Cartel, and the wind-debts owed for crossings, threaten the new cooperation.","outcome":"Wardens, millers and the Cartel agree to work together on the rebuilding, and Veya learns that truths are safer shared.","depends_on":["scn_the_hollow_feasts"]}]}]}
