rather than hide, and she sends word to Veya.","depends_on":["scn_hidden_route_survey"]},{"id":"scn_veya_shares_the_charts","title":"Veya Shares the Charts","summary":"At Silverspine Academy, Veya meets Kael as the bridges begin to fail. She chooses to publish her charts to everyone rather than let Kael hoard them.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to get the safe route to every isle. Kael wants to stop her and own the route.","conflict":"Kael offers Veya the recognition she wants if she keeps the charts private, and her fear of becoming like him is tested against her wish for credit.","outcome":"Veya publishes the charts openly and the route is used by every isle, and Kael sees control cost him the monopoly he was seeking.","depends_on":["scn_cartel_seizes_the_route"]}]},{"id":"act_04_after_the_drift","title":"After the Drift","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_kael_counts_the_cost","title":"Kael Counts the Cost","summary":"At Mistral Docks, Kael faces the Cartel's losses and sees that control cost more than it gained, and he ends the grain levy.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael"],"goal":"Salvage what he can of the Cartel's position.","conflict":"His belief that price equals worth fights with what he has seen, and the Cartel's princes want to keep the levy.","outcome":"Kael ends the levy and opens the tolls, and the Toll War ends.","depends_on":["scn_veya_shares_the_charts"]},{"id":"scn_the_hollow_feasts","title":"The Hollow Feasts","summary":"The Hollow's windmills keep grinding as the route opens, and Maris sees that hiding can be as brave as standing, and that she can do both.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Restore the grain trade and the friendship between Maris and Veya.","conflict":"Maris still struggles to forgive and to trust, and wind-debts left by the crisis must still be repaid.","outcome":"Maris and Veya renew their alliance and the Hollow Circle trades openly again.","depends_on":["scn_kael_counts_the_cost"]},{"id":"scn_new_charts_new_bridges","title":"New Charts, New Bridges","summary":"At Emberroost, Veya and the Wardens braid new cables along the shared route, with her charts open to everyone, and Veya accepts that the work belongs to all.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris","chr_kael"],"goal":"Begin rebuilding the skybridge network along the shared route.","conflict":"Old suspicions between the Wardens and the Cartel, and the wind-debts owed for crossings, threaten the new cooperation.","outcome":"Wardens, millers and the Cartel agree to work together on the rebuilding, and Veya learns that truths are safer shared.","depends_on":["scn_the_hollow_feasts"]}]}]}
