"]},{"id":"scn_rival_confrontation","title":"Ledger and Chart","summary":"Kael confronts Veya at Silverspine and offers a bargain: give the Cartel exclusive control of the route, and he will shield The Hollow from the levy. He admires her skill but cannot let her succeed on her own terms.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Kael wants the route exclusively for the Cartel. Veya wants it open to all.","conflict":"His offer would save Maris's home at the cost of Veya's principles, and Maris must choose between her loyalty to home and her friendship with Veya.","outcome":"Veya refuses to bury the route, and Maris, who stays loyal to both, backs her. Kael leaves vowing to take the bridges by force. All three now race for the same crossing.","depends_on":["scn_silverspine_archive"]}]},{"id":"act_climax","title":"The Last Crossing","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_docks_gathering","title":"Rallying the Isles","summary":"At Mistral Docks, Veya publicly shares her chart with merchants, Wardens and Hollow Circle members, while Maris uses her corridors to bring grain and allies through. Kael's hold on information starts to slip.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants to share the route widely so it cannot be buried. Kael wants to stop the broadcast and seize the route.","conflict":"Kael's enforcers and his ledger-mastery turn merchants' wind-debts against the plan. Veya's pride must give way to relying on others.","outcome":"The merchants split, and enough of them back Veya that the Cartel cannot close the route at the docks. Kael falls back to the last crossing to take it by force.","depends_on":["scn_rival_confrontation"]},{"id":"scn_emberroost_crossing","title":"The Last Skybridge","summary":"At Emberroost, the last stable skybridge begins to fail as Kael's party and Veya's convoy meet on it. Veya reads the wind currents to hold the bridge while