utcome":"The chart is released to all isles, and Kael, now a rival who respects her, helps distribute it.","depends_on":["scn_wardens_accord"]},{"id":"scn_hollow_harvest","title":"Hiding and Standing","summary":"In The Hollow, Maris watches the first free grain barges leave and shares her secret corridors with the Circle. She understands that hiding can be as brave as standing still, and Veya visits as a friend.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Make sure The Hollow is fed and end her life as a smuggler.","conflict":"Maris still struggles to trust outsiders, and her secret corridors must now be shared.","outcome":"Maris opens her routes to the Circle and forgives Veya. The Hollow is secure and the isles remain bound together.","depends_on":["scn_silverspine_atlas"]}]}]}
